A computed mapping reading an optional field into a field the target
requires: coalesce says what to use when it is absent.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	count?: int32
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	total: int64
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		total: v0_0.count * 2
		count: _drop
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0343]: v0_0.count * 2 reads v0_0.count, which 0.0 may omit, and 1.0 requires total
 --> 1.0.thema:8:3
  |
8 |         total: v0_0.count * 2
  |         ^^^^^
  |
  = help: write _coalesce(v0_0.count * 2, <fallback>) to say what to use when it is absent
